    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"Task.State.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Task.State</code></a> defining the lifecycle phase the actual <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Task</code></a>.",
